    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "793429a2-7b4a-3098-bc82-823828448a97",
                "word": "Agnes",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                        "entry_id": "793429a2-7b4a-3098-bc82-823828448a97",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name from Ancient Greek."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8a72a77-9e34-40f0-a514-f35732343bad",
                                "sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                                "text": "Why do you call Mrs. Stone Aggie? Agnes is such a beautiful name, it is a shame to nick it in that way.\" Then, quickly regretting his impatience, he added, \"You would not have been jealous, would you, Jenny?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba5a7ae2-8c2c-4f37-bd29-edfb06a48767",
                                "sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                                "text": "Right then and there in her mind she had christened it Agnes, the only name she knew elegant enough for such a peerless creature. - - - She held the doll so her brothers could see. \"Look, isn't she beautiful? Her name is Agnes.[...]Agnes? Agnes?\" Jack gagged realistically. \"What a soppy name! Why don't you call her Margaret or Betty?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "938bfbb1-9f4d-4ad6-856a-4c93a82acf62",
                                "sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                                "text": "I found myself wanting to explain it to her, this middle-aged woman with the kind of haircut you call a hairdo, which needed to be set in rollers every night, who had a name like Agnes or Harriet, a name that even predated my mother's generation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbb90006-bb13-45e8-acc7-6e4a9964d1ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "793429a2-7b4a-3098-bc82-823828448a97",
                        "source_sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                        "source_sense_description": "female given name",
                        "target_lang_word": "Anežka",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Anežka",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f7baeda-9dd4-38aa-8600-d8d5bcdd6eef",
                                        "entry_id": "8943a0a2-f3dc-3c2e-8c48-5f7c7caf22b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ženské křestní jméno"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8e1af41-fd0a-491c-96cc-45ff964c4c6b",
                                                "sense_id": "5f7baeda-9dd4-38aa-8600-d8d5bcdd6eef",
                                                "text": "Podle starého proroctví v Čechách nastane mír, pokoj i blahobyt, až dojde ke kanonizaci (Přemyslovny) Anežky. Proroctví se (snad) naplnilo: Anežka byla kanonizována 12. listopadu 1989 a o pět dní později v Praze začala sametová revoluce."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "abd4e8db-ba8c-4fd7-95ee-30587bb89e87",
                        "source_entry_id": "793429a2-7b4a-3098-bc82-823828448a97",
                        "source_sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                        "source_sense_description": "female given name",
                        "target_lang_word": "Agnes",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Agnes",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9560a357-98f5-3a27-a5ac-a2260ea8bdf6",
                                        "entry_id": "5336e33e-0e1d-30de-b9d6-0e930f368826",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "meisjesnaam"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "feminine",
                                            "name"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db178df3-5710-44de-9e3b-fdcb820d81a7",
                                                "sense_id": "9560a357-98f5-3a27-a5ac-a2260ea8bdf6",
                                                "text": "Er liggen er ook aardig wat in hun graf, zoals Agnes, van wie we lange tijd dachten dat ze, zoals ze had aangekondigd, terug naar haar geboortedorp in Haut-Rhin was verhuisd om voor haar bejaarde moeder te zorgen, terwijl ze al geruime tijd in een gemeentegraf op La Villette lag."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e373a31-5191-40c9-8018-a49ac0e467f7",
                                                "sense_id": "9560a357-98f5-3a27-a5ac-a2260ea8bdf6",
                                                "text": "Die suiker is ruim een week geleden uit Suriname aangekomen, maar Frans en Agnes weten nog steeds niet wat je ermee gaat doen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "513ee135-676a-48b4-9ed9-9a0ac2a1dbea",
                        "source_entry_id": "793429a2-7b4a-3098-bc82-823828448a97",
                        "source_sense_id": "61f95e80-b832-3255-aa5c-9d316f5f44e6",
                        "source_sense_description": "female given name",
                        "target_lang_word": "Agnès",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Agnès",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d157bbdb-bedf-3a79-8fba-dc2c4fe0f235",
                                        "entry_id": "64f6d74f-f6ad-32d1-bf9a-eaf7cac92fd7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de famille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdf1d226-1035-4259-944c-0908e06829a0",
                                                "sense_id": "d157bbdb-bedf-3a79-8fba-dc2c4fe0f235",
                                                "text": "Douze personnes détenues ont participé à cet atelier de pratique artistique, encadré, cette année, par le chorégraphe Djino Alolo Sabin et la comédienne Elsa Agnès."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Agnès",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88e08191-07f7-3842-8372-7836e1db4d4b",
                                        "entry_id": "fbd19e60-bd8b-3a54-a0ce-ef3e58825453",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "654828fc-4902-4635-984a-a44ba9a26b79",
                                                "sense_id": "88e08191-07f7-3842-8372-7836e1db4d4b",
                                                "text": "Pépère Moïse, mémère Agnès\n C’était dans le temps de leur vieillesse\n La vie s’achève doucement\n Pour les grand-pères, les grand-mamans\n On les entoure de tendresse\n On fait comme si de rien n’était\n Mais c’est autour d’eux qu’on s’empresse\n Y seront p’t-être pas là l’an prochain."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd9a0d73-5c84-4b40-ba93-7c54182ad1d3",
                                                "sense_id": "88e08191-07f7-3842-8372-7836e1db4d4b",
                                                "text": "« À Paris, l’hyperdensification a fait long feu », insiste Agnès Evren, conseillère LR de Paris."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2358871-3c09-443a-a700-dfa4a8531c41",
                                                "sense_id": "88e08191-07f7-3842-8372-7836e1db4d4b",
                                                "text": "« Pour mon petit frère, je demande toujours l’opinion de ma mère qui vit avec lui », raconte Agnès Roth, qui va même jusqu’à s’adresser au principal intéressé si la réponse ne la satisfait pas, toujours dans le souci de « faire plaisir »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Agnès",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12db6019-2841-31b4-b2ab-a8bbf22ea73c",
                                        "entry_id": "4504bcf1-79dd-3a7f-8191-1a06c3ad48ef",
